    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Enjoy the best of both worlds at Brownswood, Portlaw—a beautifully restored traditional stone farmhouse set on approximately 25.9 acres, offering peaceful country living just minutes from Carrick-on-Suir and with convenient access to the main road. Combining timeless rural appeal with spacious accommodation, the property provides a wonderful balance of comfort, privacy and outdoor space.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation has been carefully maintained and includes welcoming reception rooms full of character, a generous kitchen fitted with cream shaker-style units, and bright living spaces ideal for both everyday family life and entertaining. Upstairs, the well-proportioned bedrooms offer comfortable accommodation while retaining the warmth and charm expected of a traditional farmhouse.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property is equally impressive. Mature trees, stone walls, landscaped lawns and a gravel courtyard create an attractive setting, while the adjoining land extends the lifestyle opportunities available to the next owner. Traditional stone outbuildings further enhance the property's appeal, offering valuable additional space while complementing the character of the farmhouse.\r\n\r\nOne of Brownswood's greatest strengths is its accessibility. While surrounded by open countryside and mature grounds, the property enjoys convenient access to the main road and is only a short drive from Carrick-on-Suir, allowing you to enjoy rural living without sacrificing everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nWhether you are seeking a family home in a peaceful rural setting, a property with extensive outdoor space, or simply the charm of an authentic stone residence surrounded by countryside, Brownswood presents an exceptional opportunity to enjoy country living in a beautiful and established setting.\r\n\r\nFor more info, visit: https://listings.sheeandhawe.com/brownswood"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Traditional stone farmhouse with abundant original character & historic architecture.\r\n\r\nApproximately 10.5 hectares of adjoining land.\r\n\r\nAttractive gravel courtyard framed by original stone buildings.\r\n\r\nMature gardens with established trees and stone boundary walls.\r\n\r\nSpacious farmhouse kitchen with generous storage and workspace.\r\n\r\nMultiple reception rooms offering flexible family living.\r\n\r\nTraditional stone outbuildings complementing the main residence.\r\n\r\nScenic rural setting with open countryside surrounding the property.\r\n\r\nExtensive outdoor space suitable for a wide variety of lifestyle needs.\r\n\r\nPeaceful countryside setting with convenient access to the main road and just minutes from Carrick-on-Suir."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: D2"
      }
